<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $106/dressed basis - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $106/dressed basis - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Carcass basis had a higher undertone noted on steers and heifers.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs few  106.00</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1200 lbs few 106.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wed: 200   Week to Date: 5,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
